<p> Net shr	   $0.28		    $0.29</p>
<p> Net		 6,932		    6,412</p>
<p> Revs		34,390		   27,248</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  21,889		   21,886</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
